2875 |    * SECTION 2 — NODE_EDGE_TAXONOMY
2876 |    * SECTION 3 — MODULE_SEQUENCE_ATOMIC
2877 |    * SECTION 4 — DELTA_AND_GAPS
2878 | 
2879 | Nothing more, nothing less.
2880 | 
2881 | END OF CHAOS-DECOMPOSER v1.6 MONOLITH
