4893 | Taxonomy: M0 → M14 — “5W+How” + 5 Whys
4894 | M0 — M0_session_init_and_state_load
4895 | Definition: Ingests raw input, tokenizes into S_raw_corpus, initializes runtime state objects (S_session_ledger, S_rule_registry, S_change_request_log).
4896 | 5W+How
4897 | 
4898 | Who: Session runner / Decomposer core (M0 agent) — first touchpoint for any run.
4899 | 
4900 | What: Parse and index user paste(s), files, UST blocks; create initial ledger and rule registry.
4901 | 
4902 | When: Immediately at run start (first module executed).
4903 | 
4904 | Where: Local runtime memory / persistent store (S_raw_corpus + S_session_ledger).
4905 | 
