4927 | 
4928 | What: Extract rule-like instructions; apply precedence; annotate superseded rules.
4929 | 
4930 | When: Immediately after ingestion (M0) and whenever new messages arrive.
4931 | 
4932 | Where: S_rule_registry, S_change_request_log (state store).
4933 | 
