5458 | E — Where SEG & G-Card live in your module flow (precise mapping)
5459 | Detection: M0 (ingest) + M4 (parser) — find SEG/G_CARD markers or generate defaults.
5460 | 
5461 | Evaluation: M6 (SME round-robin) produces criterion scores that feed M7.
